flowchart LR
    A[User / Tool / System] --> B[Acquire]
    B --> C[Classify]
    C --> D[Score]
    D --> E[Represent]
    E --> F[Preserve or Transform]
    F --> G[Externalize]
    G --> H[Retrieve]
    H --> I[Assemble]
    I --> J[Model Call]
    J --> K[Observe]
    K --> L[Re-evaluate]
    L --> B
    F --> M[Discard]
    G --> N[Memory / Storage]
    H --> N
    N --> O[Active Context]
    O --> I
